---
// The precached offline fallback: what a surfer with nothing kept on their
// phone lands on when there is no signal to fetch a live page
// (application-architecture.md section 4, route `/sin-senal`). Ships today;
// the second settled sentence, "Los reportes que mandes quedan guardados.",
// is FALSE until slice-03 builds the report queue, so it is deliberately
// absent here -- no step in this roadmap may add it before then.
//
// The settled sentence names the hour of the last thing we saw ("...de las
// {hora}."), filled by the offline helper at serve time when it answers this
// page from its own cache (a later step in this slice). This document is
// built once, offline, with no forecast data and no last-seen hour to read,
// so baking an hour here would report when the SITE was published, not when
// this PHONE last saw a forecast -- a different and less honest claim. The
// honest fallback until that helper exists: the sentence without the hour
// clause, never a placeholder token.
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { paths } from '../i18n/routes';
---

<Base locale="es" title="Sin señal" currentPath={paths.offline()}>
  <h1>Sin señal. Esto es lo último que vimos.</h1>
</Base>
